{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Packet:\n# Identificação\n\n- ID: `usecase:complete_task`\n- Camada: application\n- Módulo: tasks\n- source: `app/application/complete-task.ts:12`\n- Estado: declared\n- specHash: `c51f2de963ef8c242f9c9ba599d98f288b705342798064b5aa5bc4edf2d2428d`\n- Dependências: `method:Task.complete`\n\n## Especificação\n\nDeclaração, regras de construção e contratos referenciados:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"contracts\": [\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Uma tarefa foi concluída.\",\n      \"id\": \"event:TaskCompleted\",\n      \"module\": \"tasks\",\n      \"name\": \"TaskCompleted\",\n      \"payloadSchema\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"taskId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"taskId\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Uma tarefa foi criada.\",\n      \"id\": \"event:TaskCreated\",\n      \"module\": \"tasks\",\n      \"name\": \"TaskCreated\",\n      \"payloadSchema\": {\n        \"additionalProperties\": false,\n        \"properties\": {\n          \"taskId\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          },\n          \"title\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n          }\n        },\n        \"required\": [\n          \"taskId\",\n          \"title\"\n        ],\n        \"type\": \"object\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"description\": \"Conclui uma tarefa pendente; repetição falha com TASK_ALREADY_COMPLETED.\",\n      \"emits\": [\n        \"event:TaskCompleted\"\n      ],\n      \"entity\": {\n        \"description\": \"Tarefa com título e ciclo de vida pendente ou concluído.\",\n        \"id\": \"entity:Task\",\n        \"invariants\": [\n          {\n            \"id\": \"invariant:Task/titulo-obrigatorio\",\n            \"on\": null,\n            \"text\": \"Toda tarefa precisa de título não vazio.\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"methods\": [\n          {\n            \"description\": \"Cria uma tarefa pendente e remove espaços nas extremidades do título.\",\n            \"emits\": [\n              \"event:TaskCreated\"\n            ],\n            \"id\": \"method:Task.create\",\n            \"name\": \"create\",\n            \"static\": true,\n            \"transition\": null\n          }\n        ],\n        \"module\": \"tasks\",\n        \"name\": \"Task\",\n        \"states\": [\n          \"pending\",\n          \"completed\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"id\": \"method:Task.complete\",\n      \"invariants\": [],\n      \"name\": \"complete\",\n      \"static\": false,\n      \"transition\": {\n        \"from\": [\n          \"pending\"\n        ],\n        \"to\": \"completed\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"declaration\": {\n    \"description\": \"Carrega, conclui, salva e publica a tarefa; id ausente falha com TASK_NOT_FOUND.\",\n    \"emits\": [\n      \"event:TaskCompleted\"\n    ],\n    \"id\": \"usecase:complete_task\",\n    \"inputSchema\": {\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"task_id\": {\n          \"minLength\": 1,\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"task_id\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"module\": \"tasks\",\n    \"name\": \"complete_task\",\n    \"outputSchema\": {\n      \"additionalProperties\": false,\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"status\": {\n          \"const\": \"completed\",\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"task_id\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"task_id\",\n        \"status\"\n      ],\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"uses\": [\n      \"method:Task.complete\"\n    ],\n    \"whenNotToUse\": \"Para criar uma nova tarefa.\",\n    \"whenToUse\": \"Quando o usuário terminou uma tarefa.\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## Obrigações de teste\n\n- `usecase:complete_task` — teste com `covers`.\n\n##